&lt;h3 id=&#34;基尼系数gini-coefficient&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#基尼系数gini-coefficient&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; 基尼系数（Gini coefficient）&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intratumoral CD4+T Cells Mediate Anti-tumor Cytotoxicity in Human Bladder Cancer, 2020, Cell&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gini indices for each CD8+T cell cluster calculated for each patient, showing significant clonal expansion within exhausted CD8+T cells.&lt;br /&gt;
Clonal replacement of tumor-specific T cells following PD-1 blockade, 2019, Nature Medicine&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;香农指数shannon-equitability-index&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#香农指数shannon-equitability-index&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; 香农指数（Shannon equitability index）&lt;/h3&gt;
